  "details": "1. Setup an Udon program to use `Networking.LocalPlayer.PlayHapticEventInHand` and provide it a negative amplitude.\n\n2. Build & Test or Publish the world for Android\n\n3. On an Android Flatscreen device launch the world.\n\n4. Activate the Udon program and notice the java illegal argument exception.\n\nTested with the parameters: `Right`, `0.1`, `-0.05`, `1`. Notably this does not cause an exception on Meta Quest native (Quest 2 on open-beta).",
